{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:97b4a703177c0701","name":"Triangulation Visor","source":{"id":"source:reference-97b4a703177c0701","title":"Triangulation Visor","revision":20979,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T00:55:01Z","sha256":"70bfc230eef6c27abf7008f7b916777dac0eb0cdf42ab1ccaa1f066d73315cfe","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20979","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Triangulation%20Visor&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-97b4a703177c0701","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Galaxy at War"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Galaxy_at_War"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 1,400\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weight:"]}," 0.5 Kilograms\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The Triangulation Visor provides a heads-up display to help wielders of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Heavy Weapons"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Heavy_Weapons","referenceId":"reference:a2b1d4c4bac82300"}," to account for wind, gravity, distance, and other effects when targeting shots. The Triangulation Visor works only with weapons that fire solid rounds, such as slugthrowers, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mortar Launchers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mortar_Launchers"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Missile Launchers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Missile_Launchers"},", and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Grenade Launchers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Grenade_Launchers"},". It does not work with blasters, lasers, or other Energy weapons. The Triangulation Visor reduces the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Range"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Range"}," by one category (for example, from Long to Medium ",{"tag":"a","children":["Range"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Range"},"). A Triangulation Visor cannot be worn at the same time as a helmet or any other device worn on the head.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
